Oh cool, I see we casually have an "enemies of the administration" list for people in the media now, hosted using my taxpayer money on the White House website.

Looking forward to all of the libertarian and "free speech" types to take a strong position on this!

@dpakman, @EdKrassen and @briantylercohen are the first three listed.

